1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:10,680
(Transcribed by TurboScribe.ai. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Little Fox The Tale of Jemima Puddle Duck

2
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:19,520
Episode 3 Nine Eggs The fox led Jemima

3
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,420
to his shed.

4
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:33,820
Jemima looked inside.

5
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,040
Hmm, said Jemima.

6
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,640
Why are there so many feathers in there?

7
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,880
The fox didn't answer.

8
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:52,040
It does look warm and cozy, said Jemima.

9
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,780
So Jemima went in.

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,780
She gathered straw and feathers.

11
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:05,380
Soon she had a nice warm nest.

12
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:11,820
I'll be back tomorrow, she said.

13
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:15,900
I'll take care of your nest, said the

14
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:16,320
fox.

15
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:21,840
You're so kind, said Jemima.

16
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,240
Thank you.

17
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:37,480
Each day, Jemima came to the shed.

18
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:43,440
She went inside and laid an egg.

19
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:46,760
Then she went home in the evening.

20
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,220
Jemima went to bed.

21
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:17,920
Each night, the fox counted the eggs.

22
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,630
He turned them over and smiled.

23
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:27,810
They're so big, he said.

24
00:02:28,450 --> 00:02:30,730
They look delicious.

25
00:02:34,530 --> 00:02:39,110
At last, nine eggs filled the nest.

26
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:45,090
I'm done, Jemima said.

27
00:02:45,670 --> 00:02:47,710
I'll be back tomorrow.

28
00:02:48,990 --> 00:02:52,450
Then I'll stay until my eggs hatch.

29
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:57,870
Wonderful, said the fox.

30
00:02:58,830 --> 00:03:00,830
He licked his lips.

31
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:05,750
Please bring some herbs tomorrow, he said.

32
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:10,550
I will cook a big dinner for us.
